Package: mica-ca-trust
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Mica OS <hi@micaos.dev>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: TLS trust anchors for Mica OS
 The Debian trust store as data: /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt, the anchors
 under /usr/share/ca-certificates with their hash links, and
 /etc/ca-certificates.conf. It is generated at build time from the pinned
 ca-certificates archive and checked against the recorded anchor digest;
 openssl and the store's maintenance tools are not installed.
